    "image_text_Xn3CFe": {
      "type": "image_text",
      "blocks": {
        "bl_liquid_XCUaDm": {
          "type": "bl_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<iframe width=\"300\" height=\"533\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/9wGBmeWwgmI\" title=\"[GUIDE] How to measure your foot correctly | Ahinsa shoes\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>",
            "col_dk": "6",
            "col_tb": "6"
          }
        },
        "bl_text_3rJGYh": {
          "type": "bl_text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": false,
            "smaller_text": false,
            "col_dk": "6",
            "col_tb": "6",
            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "How to measure your feet",
            "text": "<p>It's simple. All you need is a box or another object with a straight edge. Take off your sock before measuring.<br\/><br\/>If the measurement doesn't go well, don't worry. We'll <a href=\"\/pages\/refund-portal\" title=\"Exchange, returns and claims\">exchange<\/a> your Ahinsa shoes for free, in a flash.<\/p><ol><li>Stand with your <strong>heel completely against the wall<\/strong>. Put your weight on the foot.<br\/><\/li><\/ol><p>2. Place the box in front of your toes <strong>parallel to the wall<\/strong>.<\/p><p>3. Measure the distance perpendicularly <strong>from the wall to the box<\/strong>.<\/p><p>In a healthy shoe, you need a little extra free space so the foot can work naturally. So don't be alarmed if the shoes feel “bigger”.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#202020",
            "hd_color": "#202020",
            "des_color": "#202020",
            "use_shadow": false,
            "button_label": "Button label",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "default"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["bl_liquid_XCUaDm", "bl_text_3rJGYh"],
      "settings": {
        "design_heading": "1",
        "heading_align": "t4s-text-center",
        "top_heading": "",
        "icon_heading": "las la-gem",
        "top_subheading": "",
        "tophead_mb": 30,
        "space_h_item": "20",
        "space_v_item": "10",
        "space_h_item_mb": "20",
        "space_v_item_mb": "10",
        "layout": "t4s-container-wrap",
        "cl_bg": "",
        "cl_bg_gradient": "",
        "mg": ",,50px,",
        "pd": "",
        "mg_tb": "",
        "pd_tb": "",
        "mg_mb": ",,30px,",
        "pd_mb": "",
        "use_cus_css": false,
        "code_cus_css": ""
      }
    },
    "image_text_UBTwQD": {
      "type": "image_text",
      "blocks": {
        "bl_text_BweCUB": {
          "type": "bl_text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": false,
            "smaller_text": false,
            "col_dk": "6",
            "col_tb": "6",
            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "Not sure? We’ll help",
            "text": "<p>We know Ahinsa shoes... well, as our own shoes. We'll pick the right size for you in no time.<\/p><p><\/p><p>All you need to do is <strong>trace an outline of your foot on paper<\/strong> and write to us. How?<\/p><p><\/p><ol><li>Take off your sock, stand on the paper and put your weight on the foot.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li>Take a pencil and trace around the foot. <strong>Keep the pencil upright,<\/strong> don't draw under the foot.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li>Then <strong>scan<\/strong> the paper and send it to<strong> <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:mailtoinfo@ahinsashoes.com\" title=\"mailto:mailtoinfo@ahinsashoes.com\"><strong>info@ahinsashoes.com<\/strong><\/a>.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li>Add a <strong>scale:<\/strong> For example, write that it's A4 paper, or photograph a ruler with it.<br\/><br\/><\/li><li>Attach a <strong>photo of your feet<\/strong>.<\/li><\/ol><p><\/p><p>Within 2 days, we'll write to you which model and size are ideal for you.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#202020",
            "hd_color": "#202020",
            "des_color": "#202020",
            "use_shadow": false,
            "button_label": "Button label",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "default"
          }
