    "image_text_zePBDe": {
      "type": "image_text",
      "blocks": {
        "bl_text_JEAGRz": {
          "type": "bl_text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": false,
            "smaller_text": false,
            "col_dk": "6",
            "col_tb": "6",
            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "3D foot measurement",
            "text": "<p>We’ve equipped Lukáš Klimpera’s physiotherapy practice with a <strong>Footscan<\/strong> device, which makes it easy for the physiotherapist to analyse your gait.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Thanks to Footscan, among other things, we’ll answer important questions:<\/p><ul><li>Do I walk healthily?<\/li><li>What shoes should I wear?<\/li><li>Why do my feet or back hurt after a walk?<\/li><\/ul>",
            "subhd_color": "#202020",
            "hd_color": "#202020",
            "des_color": "#202020",
            "use_shadow": false,
            "button_label": "Reserve your appointment in time",
            "button_link": "shopify:\/\/pages\/footscan",
            "open_link": "_self",
            "btn_icon": false,
