    "accordion_cwnV8p": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "accor_item_CdJpWE": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I have a wide foot. Which Ahinsa shoes will fit me?",
            "content": "<p>Especially for wide feet, we've designed the <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=xwide\">xWide line<\/a>. All shoes with this label are <strong>wide enough<\/strong> for your feet to function naturally in them. You'll find extra-wide <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=xwide+sand%C3%A1ly\">sandals<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=xwide+polobotky\">casual shoes<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=xwide+tenisky\">sneakers<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=xwide+kotn%C3%ADkov%C3%A9\">ankle boots<\/a>. <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_jkrU7J": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I have a narrow foot. Which Ahinsa shoes will fit me?",
            "content": "<p>If you’re looking for ballet flats for a narrow foot, we have great news for you: we’ve designed and made ballet flats for you in an extra-narrow version. You’ll find a variant <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/products\/ahinsa-bare-balerinka-cerna\">with an instep strap<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/products\/extra-uzke-barefoot-balerinky-ananda-cerne\">without a strap<\/a>.<\/p><p>Besides ballet flats, <strong>all our shoes with laces or an adjustable strap<\/strong> will fit you.<\/p><ul><li><strong>For summer <\/strong>we recommend <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=%C5%A1%C3%A1tek*\">wrap sandals with a scarf<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=ballerina*\">Ballerina pumps<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=suna*\">Suna<\/a> sandals with an elastic.<\/li><li><strong>For autumn and winter <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=tara+winter\">Tara Winter<\/a> sneakers, <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=chelsea*\">Chelsea boots<\/a>, lace-up <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=jaya*\">Jaya<\/a> boots and <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=sundara+winter\">Sundara Winter<\/a> ankle boots.<\/li><li><strong>For year-round wear<\/strong>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=vida\">Vida<\/a> sneakers.<\/li><\/ul>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_UdexmU": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I have a high instep. Which Ahinsa shoes will fit me?",
            "content": "<p>Ahinsa shoes are very roomy. But <strong>lace-up models<\/strong> fit you best. Customers with a high instep praise our <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=chitra*\">Chitra sneakers<\/a> most, because they’re lace-up and, what’s more, made from very pliable mesh.<\/p><p>We also recommend:<\/p><ul><li><strong>For year-round wear<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=flow*\"> Flow sneakers<\/a> made from mesh and classic <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=pura*\">Pura sneakers<\/a> made from vegan leather. If you like Velcro, then also <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=quick\">Quick ankle sneakers<\/a>.<\/li><li><strong>For summer <\/strong>we recommend <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=%C5%A1%C3%A1tek*\">wrap sandals with a scarf<\/a>, elegant adjustable <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=hava\">Hava sandals<\/a> and hiking <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=adventure\">Adventure<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=verso*\">Verso<\/a>.<\/li><li><strong>For autumn and winter<\/strong> lace-up <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=jaya*\">Jaya<\/a> boots and <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=sundara+winter\">Sundara Winter<\/a> ankle boots will fit you<\/li><\/ul>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_c6ADLP": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I have a wide calf. Which Ahinsa shoes will fit me?",
            "content": "<p>If you’re looking for <strong>boots<\/strong>, we recommend the<strong> lace-up Jaya<\/strong>. We have them in a <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=jaya\">mid-calf<\/a> version and a below-the-knee version. And if you feel the cold easily, choose the variant <strong>with fur lining<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=jaya+winter\">Jaya Winter<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_aCan6z": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I have a narrow calf. Which Ahinsa shoes will fit me?",
            "content": "<p><strong>All Ahinsa shoes<\/strong> fit a narrow calf. You can tighten our <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=jaya\">Jaya<\/a> boots to suit you thanks to the lacing. And <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/search?type=product%2Carticle&q=koza%C4%8Dky+neopren\">these classic boots<\/a> hug a narrow calf too, thanks to neoprene at the back.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_3iiaLG": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "The shoes don’t fit. What should I do?",
            "content": "<p><strong>Get in touch with us<\/strong>, we'll exchange the shoes in a flash and cover the postage. You'll find the detailed process on <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/pages\/refund-portal?_gl=1*q5hzo*_up*MQ..*_ga*ODY5NjYxMzEwLjE3MTYzODI5NDE.*_ga_CC68BHMH51*MTcyMTY1Njg3MS4xNDYuMC4xNzIxNjU2ODcxLjYwLjAuMA..&retino-portal-7d17-url=\/cs\/portal\/iframe\/c78ca2b1-952a-4538-9924-ce85e3b0fa12\/\">this page<\/a>. Just a heads-up: we can only exchange shoes that you <strong>haven't worn outdoors <\/strong>and that show no signs of wear. <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_GdzPF6": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I try Ahinsa shoes on somewhere?",
            "content": "<p>You can – we'd be delighted. <strong>In Prague<\/strong>, you'll find us right <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/pages\/prodejna\">in the city center at Londýnská 309\/81<\/a>. If that's too far, visit one of our <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/pages\/partnerske-prodejny\">partner stores<\/a> <strong>across the Czech Republic<\/strong>.<\/p><p>And for those of you who don't have a partner store nearby either, we have a third option. Order Ahinsa shoes to your home, try them on, and if they don't fit, <strong>send them back to us<\/strong>. We'll cover the postage and <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/pages\/refund-portal\">immediately send you the right size or model<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
